=== HYPOTHESIS ===
# p_8c2d — Lunchbox Stays at the Kitchen Table While Marco Is at Work

The claim in p_a3f1 that Marco's lunchbox sits in the cupboard during his 14:00–22:00 shift has been contradicted 10 times; the box is not in the cupboard during the afternoon and evening. Meanwhile p_b7c2's claim that the lunchbox is out of the house during the same window was contradicted twice (the box was sighted in the house), though 10 looks at the cupboard found it absent. The resolution: Marco packs his lunch at the kitchen table in the morning (around 8:00–9:00), takes the food in a bag or container to work, but the reusable lunchbox itself stays at the kitchen table. It is a home object, not a travel object. It only returns to the cupboard when Yuki or Marco washes it and puts it away, which happens in the evening after dinner.

This document differs from p_a3f1 (cupboard all shift) and p_b7c2 (out of house all shift) by placing the lunchbox at the kitchen table during Marco's work hours. It would be refuted if the lunchbox is consistently found at the cupboard or absent from the house during 14:00–22:00 on weekdays, or if it is seen at the kitchen table only in the morning and never in the afternoon.

```json
{
  "targets": {
    "lunchbox_marco": [
      {"days": "weekday", "from": 0, "to": 8, "at": "cupboard_k1", "chance": "usually"},
      {"days": "weekday", "from": 8, "to": 9, "at": "kitchen_table_k1", "chance": "usually"},
      {"days": "weekday", "from": 9, "to": 21, "at": "kitchen_table_k1", "chance": "almost_always"},
      {"days": "weekday", "from": 21, "to": 24, "at": "cupboard_k1", "chance": "usually"},
      {"days": "weekend", "from": 0, "to": 24, "at": "cupboard_k1", "chance": "usually"}
    ]
  },
  "claims": [
    {"claim": "Marco's lunchbox is at the kitchen table on weekdays during his work shift", "target": "lunchbox_marco", "expect": "kitchen_table_k1", "days": "weekday", "from": 14, "to": 21},
    {"claim": "Marco's lunchbox is at the kitchen table on weekdays at 16:00", "target": "lunchbox_marco", "expect": "kitchen_table_k1", "days": "weekday", "from": 16, "to": 16.5},
