# p_f1e3 — Yuki's Keys: Out Only for the Afternoon Errand, Back by 16:30

Several documents (p_a1b2, p_e5f6, p_7890, p_c3d4) refer to "Marco's keys" while targeting `keys_yuki`, which is Yuki's key set. The only keys object in the house is Yuki's. Yuki is retired and home most of the day; her weekday routine includes a morning walk (around 7:00–8:00) and an afternoon errand. The claim in p_a1b2 that the keys are out of the house from 14:00 to 22:00 was contradicted twice (keys sighted in the house) and weakly supported 3 times (looks at entry table found nothing). The most likely explanation: Yuki's afternoon errand is shorter than the full 14:00–22:00 window. She leaves around 13:00–13:30 and is back by 15:30–16:30, after which her keys return to the entry table. The morning walk (7:00–8:00) also takes the keys out briefly.

This document differs from p_a1b2 (keys out 14–22h) by shortening the out-of-house window to 13:00–16:00, and from p_c9d4 (out 13:00–17:30) by pulling the return time earlier. It would be refuted if the keys are sighted at the entry table during 13:30–15:30 on a weekday, or if they are found out of the house after 17:00 on a weekday.

